  "prefLabel": "Lab 1402.42 Rigging equipment",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 1402.42 “Rigging equipment” means all wire ropes, chains, webbing, straps, ropes, slings, and any similar equipment, with their attachments and components, used alone or in combination, to lift, lower, or move heavy materials.\n\nSource. #14431, eff 11-22-25, EXPIRES: 11-22-35",
